   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSB&apos;s support was expected to contribute to the receiving organization being able to quickly coordinate the necessary resources for the missions, through a guaranteed HQ capacity to plan, prioritize, implement and develop the in-depth support to the receiving organization.</narrative>
